@startuml
' Figure 32.2  Identity in the trail
' Reading order: the trail line in the middle. It carries the three
' identities from the run token, the permission it spent, and a
' signature over them and the argument digest, so neither a person
' nor a key can be swapped after the fact.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
hide circle
class "Run token" as T <<policy>> {
  sub: C-118204
  act: servicing-1.0.0
  run: run-20260622T...
  itinerary: LTG-5208877
  exp: 15 minutes
}
class "Trail line" as L <<evidence>> {
  tool, verdict
  user, agent, run
  perm, args_digest
  sig, prev
}
class "Permission" as P <<policy>> {
  perm-0622-001
  one tool, one digest
  single use
}
T --> L : identities
P --> L : spent by
@enduml
